{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_Logo.gif?t=1749809605\" /><i>On-Together</i> is a\u00a0cozy productivity chatroom game that sits at the bottom of your screen while you focus on your tasks and socialize at break-time!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_RedFramed.png?t=1749809605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_PinkFramed.gif?t=1749809605\" />Stay connected while you study in a shared co-working chatroom space. Join conversations effortlessly, just like in a real study lounge\u2014whether you're working solo or with friends. Perfect for study streams or quiet collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/2A.png?t=1749809605\" />Use your personal built-in focus timer, to-do list, calendar, and journal to track tasks, set goals, and reflect on progress, keeping you focused and motivated. Stay focused long enough and a super cute customizable pet buddy will join you :)<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_GreenFramed.gif?t=1749809605\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/3A.png?t=1749809605\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>On-Together</i> lets you hang out, play multiplayer games, personalize your avatar, and more! Enjoy fun activities at your own pace, adding freedom to your workflow.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_BlueFramed.gif?t=1749809605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_YellowFramed.png?t=1749809605\" />Progress over time by staying on task, discovering new features, or engaging with the community. Unlock new customization options along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re working, studying, or just fartin\u2019 around, On-Together will help keep you company throughout the day.<br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_ShopFrame.gif?t=1749809605\" /><strong>\u2026 Oh, and did we mention we have multiple screen display options? </strong>    <br>     <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_GreyFramed.gif?t=1749809605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your cozy study companions, always on your screen\u2014whether fullscreen or neatly at the<br> bottom or top. Designed to make productivity feel both social and personal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">    Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Work together! </strong>Join your friends in the digital lounge for some cozy co-working.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Share together! </strong>Play in fullscreen or keep the screen neatly to the side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Track together! </strong>Keep on track with timers, calendars, checklists and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play together! </strong>Take regular breaks and do fun activities with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On Together! </strong>Discover new features, customize your avatar, and stay engaged.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/focus.gif?t=1749809605\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_Wishlist.gif?t=1749809605\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707400?t=1749809605","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/924682882869f91270dcaed53cb2e2af7d150487/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749809605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/5ff00ad99ce4a548c2c63164ffcf2ade6f302d9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749809605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/5ff00ad99ce4a548c2c63164ffcf2ade6f302d9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749809605","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_Logo.gif?t=1749809605\" /><i>On-Together</i> is a\u00a0cozy productivity chatroom game that sits at the bottom of your screen while you focus on your tasks and socialize at break-time!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_RedFramed.png?t=1749809605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/OT_PinkFramed.gif?t=1749809605\" />Stay connected while you study in a shared co-working chatroom space. Join conversations effortlessly, just like in a real study lounge\u2014whether you're working solo or with friends. Perfect for study streams or quiet collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.